+                '    iget-object v1, v0, LQ3/S8;->b:Ljava/lang/String;\n'
+                '    move-object/from16 v64, v1\n'
+                '    invoke-static/range {v63 .. v66}, Lcom/jeremykenedy/firetv/ui/FeaturedArtwork;->subtitle(Ljava/lang/String;Ljava/lang/String;ZZ)Ljava/lang/String;\n'
